  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* GOVUKAPP-3995 build check a vehicle component by @kris-skierniewski in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/336\r\n* GOVUKAPP-3876 Use GitHub env for qualtrics ids by @1pretz1 in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/341\r\n* NOT-405 Travel Alerts Consent Notifications Enabled by @BradleyR-Apadmi in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/344\r\n* fix: TravelAlertsWidget not always refreshing on adding/removing a country by @mattmapadmi in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/347\r\n* Prevent silent failures if the API returns unexpected MOT status values by @Krishna in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/351\r\n* Assert on DVLA decoding failures in debug builds by @Krishna in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/350\r\n* feat: NOT-478 Travel Alerts Notifications Disabled by @mattmapadmi in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/348\r\n* Fix: Add `unknown` fallback to DrivingLicenceStatus for unrecognized API values by @Krishna in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/353\r\n* GOVUKAPP-4044 - iOS27 Resizing by @RaphealOlumofe in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/352\r\n* Assert on unhandled DVLA error codes in debug builds by @Krishna in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/356\r\n* NOT-457 Travel alerts message format by @BradleyR-Apadmi in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/355\r\n* GOVUKAPP-4048 & GOVUKAPP-4049 Chat improvements by @1pretz1 in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/357\r\n* GOVUKAPP-4043 Intro accessibility label moved to top paragraph by @1pretz1 in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/346\r\n* NOT-459 Travel Alerts Push Notification logic by @BradleyR-Apadmi in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/359\r\n* GOVKUAPP-4002 update what to test copy by @kris-skierniewski in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/358\r\n* GOVUKAPP-4086 Update quarterly survey icon by @1pretz1 in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/362\r\n* GOVUKAPP-4042 Only show quarterly survey if analytics accepted by @1pretz1 in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/345\r\n* NOT-540 Fix notification consent loading state by @BradleyR-Apadmi in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/361\r\n* NOT-556 Message link to edit countries by @BradleyR-Apadmi in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/367\r\n* Feature/govukapp 3864 menu view for vehicle view by @Krishna in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/366\r\n* Release 1.8 -> main by @1pretz1 in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/364\r\n* GOVUKAPP-3999 Vehicle check result screen by @kris-skierniewski in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/354\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/compare/1.7...1.9",
